    ask_sub: "Not sure if something is safe? Describe it and ask. OrcaGuard will give you a plain-English verdict powered by Lightchain AIVM — the same network you're protecting yourself to participate in.",
    ask_title: "🤖 Ask OrcaGuard",
    ask_welcome: "Hey! I'm OrcaGuard. I help protect crypto holders from scams, phishing, and bad contracts.\n\nAsk me anything:\n• \"Is this contract address safe?\" (paste it)\n• \"I got a random token airdropped — what do I do?\"\n• \"Is this website the real Uniswap?\"\n• \"Someone in Discord is asking for my seed phrase\"\n• \"Where can I safely buy LCAI?\"\n\nI'll give you a straight answer in plain English. 🛡️",
    audit_airdrop_btn: "Scan for Scam Tokens",
    audit_airdrop_desc: "Scammers airdrop fake tokens into wallets to trick you into visiting phishing sites or approving malicious contracts. This scanner checks all ERC-20 tokens your wallet ever received on Ethereum and flags anything suspicious.",
    audit_airdrop_label: "🪂 Airdrop Scam Scanner",
    audit_approvals_btn: "Open Revoke.cash →",
    audit_approvals_html: "<p>Token approvals are permissions you've given to smart contracts to spend your tokens. Old or unlimited approvals are a security risk — a compromised contract could drain your wallet.</p><p style=\"margin-top:8px\">Use <strong style=\"color:#fff\">Revoke.cash</strong> — a trusted, free tool — to see all your active approvals and cancel the ones you don't need:</p>",
