    terms_s1_p: "OrcaGuard is a free security awareness and research tool for the Lightchain blockchain community. It is operated by an individual developer and provided as-is. It is not a professional cybersecurity firm, law enforcement agency, or licensed security service.",
    terms_s1_title: "1. What OrcaGuard Is",
    terms_s2_p: "All analysis results, risk ratings, scam warnings, contract reviews, and security information provided by OrcaGuard are for general informational and educational purposes only. Results do not constitute professional security, legal, or financial advice. Do not make security or investment decisions based solely on this tool.",
    terms_s2_title: "2. For Informational Purposes Only",
    terms_s3_p: "AI-generated analysis may be inaccurate, incomplete, or outdated. Smart contract analysis may miss vulnerabilities. Website and wallet checks rely on third-party data sources that may be incomplete. The operator makes no representations about the accuracy or completeness of any analysis result.",
    terms_s3_title: "3. AI Responses & Analysis Accuracy",
